          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.linalg import solve_triangular\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(202)\n\ndef rbf_cov(X1: np.ndarray, X2: np.ndarray, length_scale: float, signal_var: float = 1.0) -> np.ndarray:\n    sq = np.sum((X1[:, None, :] - X2[None, :, :]) ** 2, axis=-1)\n    return signal_var * np.exp(-0.5 * sq / (length_scale ** 2))\n\n# Bangkitkan 32 titik latih dengan celah (gap) besar di [0.8, 2.6] untuk menguji epistemic uncertainty\nx_left = rng.uniform(-2.5, 0.8, size=18)\nx_right = rng.uniform(2.6, 4.2, size=14)\nX_tr = np.sort(np.concatenate([x_left, x_right])).reshape(-1, 1)\nnoise_std = 0.15\nnoise_var = noise_std ** 2\ny_tr = np.sin(1.2 * X_tr[:, 0]) + 0.3 * np.cos(2.5 * X_tr[:, 0]) + rng.normal(0.0, noise_std, size=len(X_tr))\n\n# Titik uji di 3 rezim berbeda: Dalam Data (0.0), Zona Celah (1.7), Zona Ekstrapolasi Jauh (6.5)\nX_probe = np.array([[0.0], [1.7], [6.5]])\nell = 0.85\n\n# 1. Exact GP via Cholesky (Algoritma 2.1 Rasmussen & Williams — segitiga bawah murni!)\nK_tr = rbf_cov(X_tr, X_tr, length_scale=ell)\nK_y = K_tr + noise_var * np.eye(len(X_tr))\nL = np.linalg.cholesky(K_y)\nz_gp = solve_triangular(L, y_tr, lower=True)\nalpha_gp = solve_triangular(L.T, z_gp, lower=False)\n\nK_star = rbf_cov(X_probe, X_tr, length_scale=ell)\nK_ss_diag = np.ones(len(X_probe))  # signal_var = 1.0\nmu_gp = K_star @ alpha_gp\n# v = L^-1 k_*^T -> posterior variance f_* = k(x_*, x_*) - ||v||^2\nV = solve_triangular(L, K_star.T, lower=True)\nvar_f = np.maximum(K_ss_diag - np.sum(V ** 2, axis=0), 0.0)\nstd_f = np.sqrt(var_f)\nstd_y = np.sqrt(var_f + noise_var)\n\n# 2. Kernel Ridge Regression (lambda = noise_var, gamma = 1 / (2 ell^2))\nalpha_krr = np.linalg.solve(K_tr + noise_var * np.eye(len(X_tr)), y_tr)\nmu_krr = K_star @ alpha_krr\nmax_diff = float(np.max(np.abs(mu_gp - mu_krr)))\n\nprint(\"=== Kesetaraan Eksak KRR == Posterior Mean GP & Perilaku Epistemic Uncertainty ===\")\nprint(f\"Max |mu_GP - y_hat_KRR| (saat lambda = sigma_n^2 = {noise_var:.4f}): {max_diff:.2e}\")\nprint(\"-\" * 80)\nprint(\"Zona Evaluasi        | x_*  | Mean GP | Std Epistemic (f*) | Std Prediktif (y*)\")\nprint(\"-\" * 80)\nlabels = [\"In-Distribution\", \"Gap / Tanpa Data\", \"Ekstrapolasi Jauh\"]\nfor lbl, xval, m, sf, sy in zip(labels, X_probe[:, 0], mu_gp, std_f, std_y):\n    print(f\"{lbl:20s} | {xval:4.1f} | {m:7.4f} | {sf:18.4f} | {sy:18.4f}\")\n\n# 3. Dekomposisi Log Marginal Likelihood (Occam's Razor: Data Fit vs Complexity Penalty)\nprint(\"-\" * 80)\nprint(\"=== Dekomposisi Log Marginal Likelihood (LML) Lintas Length-Scale ell ===\")\nprint(\"ell  | Data Fit (-0.5 y^T K^-1 y) | Complexity (-0.5 log|K|) | Total LML\")\nprint(\"-\" * 74)\nn = len(X_tr)\nconst_term = -0.5 * n * np.log(2.0 * np.pi)\nfor ell_cand in [0.15, 0.45, 0.85, 1.80, 4.00]:\n    Kc = rbf_cov(X_tr, X_tr, length_scale=ell_cand) + noise_var * np.eye(n)\n    Lc = np.linalg.cholesky(Kc)\n    zc = solve_triangular(Lc, y_tr, lower=True)\n    ac = solve_triangular(Lc.T, zc, lower=False)\n    data_fit = -0.5 * float(y_tr @ ac)\n    complexity = -float(np.sum(np.log(np.diag(Lc))))\n    lml = data_fit + complexity + const_term\n    print(f\"{ell_cand:4.2f} | {data_fit:28.3f} | {complexity:24.3f} | {lml:9.3f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Kesetaraan Eksak KRR == Posterior Mean GP & Perilaku Epistemic Uncertainty ===\nMax |mu_GP - y_hat_KRR| (saat lambda = sigma_n^2 = 0.0225): 4.88e-15\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nZona Evaluasi        | x_*  | Mean GP | Std Epistemic (f*) | Std Prediktif (y*)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nIn-Distribution      |  0.0 |  0.1997 |             0.0829 |             0.1714\nGap / Tanpa Data     |  1.7 |  0.9605 |             0.5755 |             0.5947\nEkstrapolasi Jauh    |  6.5 |  0.0261 |             0.9992 |             1.0104\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n=== Dekomposisi Log Marginal Likelihood (LML) Lintas Length-Scale ell ===\nell  | Data Fit (-0.5 y^T K^-1 y) | Complexity (-0.5 log|K|) | Total LML\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n0.15 |                      -12.796 |                   20.416 |   -21.786\n0.45 |                      -16.465 |                   36.768 |    -9.103\n0.85 |                      -22.014 |                   43.742 |    -7.678\n1.80 |                      -33.167 |                   49.102 |   -13.470\n4.00 |                     -114.147 |                   52.718 |   -90.835",
          "actualOutput": "=== Kesetaraan Eksak KRR == Posterior Mean GP & Perilaku Epistemic Uncertainty ===\nMax |mu_GP - y_hat_KRR| (saat lambda = sigma_n^2 = 0.0225): 4.88e-15\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nZona Evaluasi        | x_*  | Mean GP | Std Epistemic (f*) | Std Prediktif (y*)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nIn-Distribution      |  0.0 |  0.1997 |             0.0829 |             0.1714\nGap / Tanpa Data     |  1.7 |  0.9605 |             0.5755 |             0.5947\nEkstrapolasi Jauh    |  6.5 |  0.0261 |             0.9992 |             1.0104\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n=== Dekomposisi Log Marginal Likelihood (LML) Lintas Length-Scale ell ===\nell  | Data Fit (-0.5 y^T K^-1 y) | Complexity (-0.5 log|K|) | Total LML\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n0.15 |                      -12.796 |                   20.416 |   -21.786\n0.45 |                      -16.465 |                   36.768 |    -9.103\n0.85 |                      -22.014 |                   43.742 |    -7.678\n1.80 |                      -33.167 |                   49.102 |   -13.470\n4.00 |                     -114.147 |                   52.718 |   -90.835",
          "explanation": "Mengimplementasikan Exact GP memakai np.linalg.cholesky dan solve_triangular, membuktikan kesetaraan numerik <1e-12 dengan KRR, memperlihatkan pelebaran std di gap & ekstrapolasi, serta menguraikan Data Fit vs Complexity Penalty pada LML.",
