          "id": "code-ml-12-3-ch12_3_scratch",
          "title": "First-Principles NumPy: Teorema Bochner (RBF & Laplacian) + Peluruhan O(1/sqrt(D))",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "12_3_rff_bochner_convergence_scratch.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(303)\nn, d = 160, 8\nX = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n, d))\n\n# Matriks Gram eksak: RBF (Gaussian) dan Laplacian (L1)\ndiff = X[:, None, :] - X[None, :, :]\ngamma_rbf = 1.0 / (2.0 * d)\ngamma_lap = 0.25\nK_rbf_exact = np.exp(-gamma_rbf * np.sum(diff ** 2, axis=-1))\nK_lap_exact = np.exp(-gamma_lap * np.sum(np.abs(diff), axis=-1))\n\ndef rff_rbf_features(X_in: np.ndarray, gamma: float, D: int, gen: np.random.Generator) -> np.ndarray:\n    # Teorema Bochner RBF: omega ~ N(0, 2*gamma*I)\n    W = gen.normal(0.0, np.sqrt(2.0 * gamma), size=(X_in.shape[1], D))\n    b = gen.uniform(0.0, 2.0 * np.pi, size=D)\n    return np.sqrt(2.0 / D) * np.cos(X_in @ W + b)\n\ndef rff_laplacian_features(X_in: np.ndarray, gamma: float, D: int, gen: np.random.Generator) -> np.ndarray:\n    # Teorema Bochner Laplacian L1: setiap koordinat omega_j ~ Cauchy(0, gamma)\n    W = gamma * gen.standard_cauchy(size=(X_in.shape[1], D))\n    b = gen.uniform(0.0, 2.0 * np.pi, size=D)\n    return np.sqrt(2.0 / D) * np.cos(X_in @ W + b)\n\nprint(\"=== Verifikasi Teorema Bochner & Peluruhan Error Monte Carlo O(1/sqrt(D)) ===\")\nprint(\"Dim D | RBF Rel-Frob | RBF MaxErr | Lap Rel-Frob | Lap MaxErr | Rasio 1/sqrt(D)\")\nprint(\"-\" * 80)\nref_frob = None\nfor D in [25, 100, 400, 1600]:\n    Z_rbf = rff_rbf_features(X, gamma_rbf, D, rng)\n    K_rbf_hat = Z_rbf @ Z_rbf.T\n    rbf_frob = float(np.linalg.norm(K_rbf_exact - K_rbf_hat, \"fro\") / np.linalg.norm(K_rbf_exact, \"fro\"))\n    rbf_max = float(np.max(np.abs(K_rbf_exact - K_rbf_hat)))\n\n    Z_lap = rff_laplacian_features(X, gamma_lap, D, rng)\n    K_lap_hat = Z_lap @ Z_lap.T\n    lap_frob = float(np.linalg.norm(K_lap_exact - K_lap_hat, \"fro\") / np.linalg.norm(K_lap_exact, \"fro\"))\n    lap_max = float(np.max(np.abs(K_lap_exact - K_lap_hat)))\n\n    if ref_frob is None:\n        ref_frob = rbf_frob\n    theo_ratio = np.sqrt(25.0 / D)\n    emp_ratio = rbf_frob / ref_frob\n    print(f\"{D:5d} | {rbf_frob:12.4f} | {rbf_max:10.4f} | {lap_frob:12.4f} | {lap_max:10.4f} | emp={emp_ratio:.2f} (teo={theo_ratio:.2f})\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Verifikasi Teorema Bochner & Peluruhan Error Monte Carlo O(1/sqrt(D)) ===\nDim D | RBF Rel-Frob | RBF MaxErr | Lap Rel-Frob | Lap MaxErr | Rasio 1/sqrt(D)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   25 |       0.3685 |     0.5705 |       1.0952 |     0.8000 | emp=1.00 (teo=1.00)\n  100 |       0.2100 |     0.3378 |       0.5629 |     0.4157 | emp=0.57 (teo=0.50)\n  400 |       0.0947 |     0.1745 |       0.2727 |     0.2012 | emp=0.26 (teo=0.25)\n 1600 |       0.0537 |     0.0831 |       0.1455 |     0.0936 | emp=0.15 (teo=0.12)",
          "actualOutput": "=== Verifikasi Teorema Bochner & Peluruhan Error Monte Carlo O(1/sqrt(D)) ===\nDim D | RBF Rel-Frob | RBF MaxErr | Lap Rel-Frob | Lap MaxErr | Rasio 1/sqrt(D)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   25 |       0.3685 |     0.5705 |       1.0952 |     0.8000 | emp=1.00 (teo=1.00)\n  100 |       0.2100 |     0.3378 |       0.5629 |     0.4157 | emp=0.57 (teo=0.50)\n  400 |       0.0947 |     0.1745 |       0.2727 |     0.2012 | emp=0.26 (teo=0.25)\n 1600 |       0.0537 |     0.0831 |       0.1455 |     0.0936 | emp=0.15 (teo=0.12)",
          "explanation": "Mengimplementasikan RFF untuk kernel RBF (Gaussian) dan Laplacian (Cauchy) dari nol, memverifikasi peluruhan galat Frobenius dan galat maksimum tepat mengikuti hukum teoritis 1/sqrt(D).",
