          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.kernel_approximation import RBFSampler\nfrom sklearn.kernel_ridge import KernelRidge\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import Ridge, SGDClassifier\nfrom sklearn.metrics import accuracy_score, root_mean_squared_error\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import Pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(313)\n\n# 1. Regresi Non-Linier (N_tr = 1000, d = 8): Bandingkan Exact KRR vs RBFSampler + Ridge\nn_tr, n_te, d = 1000, 400, 8\nX_tr = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_tr, d))\nX_te = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_te, d))\n\ndef nonlin_y(X: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n    return (\n        1.5 * np.sin(X[:, 0] + 0.7 * X[:, 1])\n        + np.exp(-0.4 * (X[:, 2] ** 2 + X[:, 3] ** 2))\n        - 0.8 * X[:, 4] * X[:, 5]\n        + 0.4 * np.cos(X[:, 6] - X[:, 7])\n    )\n\ny_tr = nonlin_y(X_tr) + rng.normal(0.0, 0.15, size=n_tr)\ny_te = nonlin_y(X_te)\n\ngamma = 0.12\nexact_krr = Pipeline([\n    (\"scaler\", StandardScaler()),\n    (\"krr\", KernelRidge(alpha=0.1, kernel=\"rbf\", gamma=gamma)),\n]).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\nrmse_exact = float(root_mean_squared_error(y_te, exact_krr.predict(X_te)))\n\nprint(\"=== Exact KernelRidge (N=1000) vs Primal RBFSampler + Ridge ===\")\nprint(\"Model                     | RMSE Uji | Jumlah Param Serving | Est. RAM N=50.000 (float64)\")\nprint(\"-\" * 92)\nram_exact_50k_gb = (50_000 * 50_000 * 8) / (1024 ** 3)\nprint(f\"{'Exact KernelRidge (RBF)':25s} | {rmse_exact:8.4f} | {n_tr * (d + 1):20d} | {ram_exact_50k_gb:10.2f} GB (OOM!)\")\n\nfor D in [50, 200, 600]:\n    rff_pipe = Pipeline([\n        (\"scaler\", StandardScaler()),\n        (\"rff\", RBFSampler(gamma=gamma, n_components=D, random_state=42)),\n        (\"ridge\", Ridge(alpha=0.1)),\n    ]).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n    rmse_rff = float(root_mean_squared_error(y_te, rff_pipe.predict(X_te)))\n    n_params = D * (d + 2) + 1  # W (d*D) + b (D) + w (D) + intercept\n    ram_rff_50k_mb = (50_000 * D * 8) / (1024 ** 2)\n    print(f\"{f'RBFSampler(D={D}) + Ridge':25s} | {rmse_rff:8.4f} | {n_params:20d} | {ram_rff_50k_mb:9.1f} MB (Aman!)\")\n\n# 2. Skala Menengah-Besar (N = 12.000) Klasifikasi Konsentris Non-Linier via RBFSampler + SGDClassifier\nn_cls = 12_000\nX_c = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_cls, 6))\nr_sq = np.sum(X_c[:, :4] ** 2, axis=1)\ny_c = ((r_sq > 3.6) ^ (X_c[:, 0] * X_c[:, 1] > 0.35)).astype(int)\n\nX_ctr, X_cte = X_c[:10_000], X_c[10_000:]\ny_ctr, y_cte = y_c[:10_000], y_c[10_000:]\n\nlin_sgd = Pipeline([(\"sc\", StandardScaler()), (\"sgd\", SGDClassifier(loss=\"log_loss\", random_state=42))]).fit(X_ctr, y_ctr)\nrff_sgd = Pipeline([\n    (\"sc\", StandardScaler()),\n    (\"rff\", RBFSampler(gamma=0.25, n_components=400, random_state=42)),\n    (\"sgd\", SGDClassifier(loss=\"log_loss\", alpha=1e-4, random_state=42)),\n]).fit(X_ctr, y_ctr)\n\nprint(\"-\" * 92)\nprint(\"=== Klasifikasi Non-Linier Skala N=10.000 (Tanpa Matriks Gram 10.000x10.000) ===\")\nprint(f\"Linear SGDClassifier saja              -> Akurasi Uji: {accuracy_score(y_cte, lin_sgd.predict(X_cte))*100:.2f}%\")\nprint(f\"RBFSampler(D=400) + SGDClassifier      -> Akurasi Uji: {accuracy_score(y_cte, rff_sgd.predict(X_cte))*100:.2f}%\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Exact KernelRidge (N=1000) vs Primal RBFSampler + Ridge ===\nModel                     | RMSE Uji | Jumlah Param Serving | Est. RAM N=50.000 (float64)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nExact KernelRidge (RBF)   |   0.3901 |                 9000 |      18.63 GB (OOM!)\nRBFSampler(D=50) + Ridge  |   0.9812 |                  501 |      19.1 MB (Aman!)\nRBFSampler(D=200) + Ridge |   0.6514 |                 2001 |      76.3 MB (Aman!)\nRBFSampler(D=600) + Ridge |   0.5047 |                 6001 |     228.9 MB (Aman!)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n=== Klasifikasi Non-Linier Skala N=10.000 (Tanpa Matriks Gram 10.000x10.000) ===\nLinear SGDClassifier saja              -> Akurasi Uji: 59.10%\nRBFSampler(D=400) + SGDClassifier      -> Akurasi Uji: 78.10%",
          "actualOutput": "=== Exact KernelRidge (N=1000) vs Primal RBFSampler + Ridge ===\nModel                     | RMSE Uji | Jumlah Param Serving | Est. RAM N=50.000 (float64)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nExact KernelRidge (RBF)   |   0.3901 |                 9000 |      18.63 GB (OOM!)\nRBFSampler(D=50) + Ridge  |   0.9812 |                  501 |      19.1 MB (Aman!)\nRBFSampler(D=200) + Ridge |   0.6514 |                 2001 |      76.3 MB (Aman!)\nRBFSampler(D=600) + Ridge |   0.5047 |                 6001 |     228.9 MB (Aman!)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n=== Klasifikasi Non-Linier Skala N=10.000 (Tanpa Matriks Gram 10.000x10.000) ===\nLinear SGDClassifier saja              -> Akurasi Uji: 59.10%\nRBFSampler(D=400) + SGDClassifier      -> Akurasi Uji: 78.10%",
