          "id": "code-ml-12-4-ch12_4_sklearn",
          "title": "Scikit-Learn: Benchmark Nystroem(rbf/poly/cosine) vs RBFSampler pada Data Ber-Manifold",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "12_4_sklearn_nystroem_vs_rff_benchmark.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.kernel_approximation import Nystroem, RBFSampler\nfrom sklearn.kernel_ridge import KernelRidge\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import Ridge\nfrom sklearn.metrics import root_mean_squared_error\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import Pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(414)\n\n# Dataset ber-manifold 3D terbenam di R^10 (N_tr = 900, N_te = 400)\nn_tr, n_te = 900, 400\nU_all = rng.uniform(-2.0, 2.0, size=(n_tr + n_te, 3))\nproj = rng.normal(0.0, 0.6, size=(3, 10))\nX_all = np.sin(U_all @ proj) + 0.05 * rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_tr + n_te, 10))\ny_all = (\n    1.8 * np.exp(-0.5 * (U_all[:, 0] ** 2 + U_all[:, 1] ** 2))\n    + 0.7 * U_all[:, 0] * U_all[:, 2]\n    - 0.5 * np.cos(1.5 * U_all[:, 2])\n)\n\nX_tr, X_te = X_all[:n_tr], X_all[n_tr:]\ny_tr = y_all[:n_tr] + rng.normal(0.0, 0.08, size=n_tr)\ny_te = y_all[n_tr:]\n\ngamma = 0.12\n# Baseline Exact KernelRidge (RBF)\nexact = Pipeline([\n    (\"sc\", StandardScaler()),\n    (\"krr\", KernelRidge(alpha=0.05, kernel=\"rbf\", gamma=gamma)),\n]).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\nrmse_exact = float(root_mean_squared_error(y_te, exact.predict(X_te)))\n\nprint(f\"=== Benchmark Manifold 3D di R^10 (Exact KRR RBF RMSE = {rmse_exact:.4f}) ===\")\nprint(\"m = D | RBFSampler + Ridge | Nystroem(rbf) + Ridge | Keunggulan Nystrom\")\nprint(\"-\" * 74)\nfor m in [30, 80, 180, 300]:\n    pipe_rff = Pipeline([\n        (\"sc\", StandardScaler()),\n        (\"rff\", RBFSampler(gamma=gamma, n_components=m, random_state=42)),\n        (\"ridge\", Ridge(alpha=0.05)),\n    ]).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n    pipe_nys = Pipeline([\n        (\"sc\", StandardScaler()),\n        (\"nys\", Nystroem(kernel=\"rbf\", gamma=gamma, n_components=m, random_state=42)),\n        (\"ridge\", Ridge(alpha=0.05)),\n    ]).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n    e_rff = float(root_mean_squared_error(y_te, pipe_rff.predict(X_te)))\n    e_nys = float(root_mean_squared_error(y_te, pipe_nys.predict(X_te)))\n    gain = (e_rff - e_nys) / e_rff * 100.0\n    print(f\"{m:5d} | {e_rff:18.4f} | {e_nys:21.4f} | {gain:+6.1f}% RMSE lebih rendah\")\n\n# Keunggulan Eksklusif Nystroem: mendukung kernel NON-shift-invariant (Polynomial, Cosine)\nprint(\"-\" * 74)\nprint(\"=== Fleksibilitas Kernel Non-Shift-Invariant pada Nystroem (Tak Tersedia di RFF) ===\")\nfor kname, kw in [\n    (\"Polynomial (degree=3)\", {\"kernel\": \"poly\", \"degree\": 3, \"gamma\": 0.1, \"coef0\": 1.0}),\n    (\"Cosine Similarity\", {\"kernel\": \"cosine\"}),\n]:\n    pipe_k = Pipeline([\n        (\"sc\", StandardScaler()),\n        (\"nys\", Nystroem(n_components=180, random_state=42, **kw)),\n        (\"ridge\", Ridge(alpha=0.05)),\n    ]).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n    e_k = float(root_mean_squared_error(y_te, pipe_k.predict(X_te)))\n    print(f\"Nystroem({kname:21s}, m=180) + Ridge -> RMSE Uji: {e_k:.4f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Benchmark Manifold 3D di R^10 (Exact KRR RBF RMSE = 0.1316) ===\nm = D | RBFSampler + Ridge | Nystroem(rbf) + Ridge | Keunggulan Nystrom\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   30 |             0.4464 |                0.4134 |   +7.4% RMSE lebih rendah\n   80 |             0.2844 |                0.1823 |  +35.9% RMSE lebih rendah\n  180 |             0.1799 |                0.1487 |  +17.4% RMSE lebih rendah\n  300 |             0.1498 |                0.1364 |   +8.9% RMSE lebih rendah\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n=== Fleksibilitas Kernel Non-Shift-Invariant pada Nystroem (Tak Tersedia di RFF) ===\nNystroem(Polynomial (degree=3), m=180) + Ridge -> RMSE Uji: 0.1733\nNystroem(Cosine Similarity    , m=180) + Ridge -> RMSE Uji: 1.1345",
          "actualOutput": "=== Benchmark Manifold 3D di R^10 (Exact KRR RBF RMSE = 0.1316) ===\nm = D | RBFSampler + Ridge | Nystroem(rbf) + Ridge | Keunggulan Nystrom\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   30 |             0.4464 |                0.4134 |   +7.4% RMSE lebih rendah\n   80 |             0.2844 |                0.1823 |  +35.9% RMSE lebih rendah\n  180 |             0.1799 |                0.1487 |  +17.4% RMSE lebih rendah\n  300 |             0.1498 |                0.1364 |   +8.9% RMSE lebih rendah\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n=== Fleksibilitas Kernel Non-Shift-Invariant pada Nystroem (Tak Tersedia di RFF) ===\nNystroem(Polynomial (degree=3), m=180) + Ridge -> RMSE Uji: 0.1733\nNystroem(Cosine Similarity    , m=180) + Ridge -> RMSE Uji: 1.1345",
          "explanation": "Membandingkan RMSE uji Nystroem + Ridge melawan RBFSampler + Ridge pada anggaran komponen m=D identik sekaligus mendemonstrasikan dukungan kernel non-shift-invariant (Polynomial & Cosine) pada Nystroem.",
